[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Legacy linear-deck annotations

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SEM-LEGACY-LINEAR-ANNOTATION-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Prepare bounded legacy listing and disabled distortion annotations
STATEMENT: >>>
Ordinary analysis preparation shall admit bare LIST, NODE, POST and TRANS options in the reporting-only option profile, without changing electrical inputs. Source preparation shall admit at most one DISTOF1 0 and one DISTOF2 0 on an otherwise supported independent excitation. Assigned forms of these reporting options, nonzero or duplicate distortion markers, additional phase terms and distortion-only source profiles shall refuse. This requirement does not admit a distortion analysis.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
DeclarationExtraction.cs, SpiceParser.g4 and SourceProfileExtraction.cs implement the boundaries. RequestedOptionConstantTests covers valid and refusing profiles. The original ngspice tests/filters/lowpass.cir qualifies OP and AC against ngspice 47+. See evidence/legacy-linear-annotations.md.
<<<
